|-------|--------|
| `grep -nE '^## [0-9]+\.' AGENTS.md` | PASS — headers sequential 1..10 |
| `grep -nE '(§|Section )(8|9|10)\b' AGENTS.md` | PASS — sole hit is external-file ref `quick-reference.md §8`, correctly untouched |
